  "details": "I think it would be nice to have the ability to set certain people to automatically accept join requests regardless of your status, like say you become unavailable but someone you really want a be with wants to join, but other people you don't want to join so you don't go on blue \n\nOr say you fall asleep in VRchat, it happens a lot, and someone wants to join you, but your on orange like usual, well, they can't join...\n\nI'm just thinking like a checkbox similar to the hide avatar button, \"auto invite\" or something like that, so that if it's checked, any time they request the game treats it like a blue status for them, and sends the the invite, even if you are on orange.\n\nPossibly even a 3rd option to let them join even if you are on red.",
